{"id":"cb6f3da63e39a685","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-trace-class.md","title":"Trace Class Operator","display":"df-trace-class — Trace Class Operator","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-trace-class","aliases":["58-df-trace-class"],"display":"df-trace-class — Trace Class Operator","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-singular-value.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-trace-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-trace-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-trace-class — Trace Class Operator"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28999e0c83253377\" href=\"?note=28999e0c83253377\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7da7ff11e397ca55\" href=\"?note=7da7ff11e397ca55\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-singular-value.md\">../batch03/58-df-singular-value.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H,T,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H\\in V\">\\(H,T,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md\">../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,H,H)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,H,H)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28999e0c83253377\" href=\"?note=28999e0c83253377\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md\">../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SingularValue}_S(s,n,T,H,H)\">\\(\\operatorname{SingularValue}_S(s,n,T,H,H)\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7da7ff11e397ca55\" href=\"?note=7da7ff11e397ca55\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-singular-value.md\">../batch03/58-df-singular-value.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TraceClass}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{TraceClass}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trace\\text{-}class\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(T,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{SingularValue}_S(s(n),n+1,T,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\n\\sum_{n\\in N}s(n)\\leq M\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trace\\text{-}class\\text{-}explicit}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(T,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\n\\land\\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists s\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}^{\\omega}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\operatorname{SingularValue}_S(s(n),n+1,T,H,H)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathbb R_{\\geq0}\\;\\forall N\\in\\omega\\;\n\\sum_{n\\in N}s(n)\\leq M\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trace\\text{-}class\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\operatorname{TraceClass}_S(T,H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(T,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}trace\\text{-}class\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\operatorname{TraceClass}_S(T,H)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(T,H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The singular-value sequence is now witnessed by the upstream five-argument predicate, and summability is expressed by bounded nonnegative partial sums. The former notation left <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_n(T)\">\\(s_n(T)\\)</span> without a source and called a nonexistent two-argument compact-operator predicate.</li>\n<li>Trace class operators have finite trace independent of basis.</li>\n<li>They form the canonical predual of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(H)\">\\(\\mathcal B(H)\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"28999e0c83253377","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-singular-value.md","status":"resolved","id":"7da7ff11e397ca55","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-singular-value.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)$ (see [[../batch13/58-df-hilbert-space.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md","status":"resolved","id":"28999e0c83253377","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,H,H)$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-compact-operator.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-singular-value.md","status":"resolved","id":"7da7ff11e397ca55","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{SingularValue}_S(s,n,T,H,H)$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-singular-value.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H,T,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H,\\langle\\cdot,\\cdot\\rangle_H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompactOperator}_S(T,H,H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SingularValue}_S(s,n,T,H,H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TraceClass}_S:V^2\\